// Retried calls by operation and code (DIAAT-281, DIAAT-282). Recording pipeline
// (Phase 2): Speech.
//
// Measure: how often calls for a recording batch job had to be retried, and why.
// Formula: sum(value) of transcription.job.retries by job.retry.operation and
//   hmcts.error.code.
// Source: counter transcription.job.retries, emitted only by the recording pipeline,
//   so no area filter: metric dimensions do not carry hmcts.area (decision 1).
//   Operations: speech.submit, speech.status, speech.results, speech.delete,
//   webhook.deliver. Never sampled (OD2).
// Caveats: a retry that then succeeds is still counted. Per-job detail: job.retried.
customMetrics
| where name == "transcription.job.retries"
| summarize retries = sum(value)
    by operation = tostring(customDimensions["job.retry.operation"]),
       error_code = tostring(customDimensions["hmcts.error.code"])
| order by retries desc
